<title>USA: American Medserve unit buys EFS Healthcare.</title>
<headline>American Medserve unit buys EFS Healthcare.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Medserve Corp said Friday its Royal Care Holdings Inc unit acquired EFS Healthcare Group of Albany, New York.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>EFS provides specialized nutrition services, prescription medical supplies and other services. The company has annual revenues of about $8 million.</p>
<p>American Medserve provides pharmaceutical care.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
